  HOOKS [{"text":"Someone keeps paying off their small debts around the place before they can, and has left no name.","source":"Alaqai Ba'arin"},{"text":"They have seen the same unmarked cart pass their door three nights running, and have not wondered why.","source":"Barlas Arlat"},{"text":"They have promised the same order to two buyers, and both are due to collect on the same morning.","source":"Abu Said Mangghud"}]
  LINE PEOPLE ["Abu Said Mangghud|seat","Purevdulam Qonggirad|cleric"]
  LINE HOOKS [{"text":"They have promised the same order to two buyers, and both are due to collect on the same morning.","source":"Abu Said Mangghud"},{"text":"They've noticed the same group of faces at multiple locations where incidents occurred. No one else has.","source":"Khurelbaatar Geniges"},{"text":"The iron carts are three weeks late and the carters will not say why. Broken tools stay broken, and work waits.","source":"Strategic Resource"}]
