  TENSION 0 generational_divide ["Traditionalists","Progressives","Pragmatic middle"] | The young want to change how things are done, and the old will not let them | hooks ["A traditional practice conceals something the elders don't want examined","A young reformer has uncovered records that undermine the old guard's legitimacy","The 'new idea' being promoted was actually tried once before, and failed badly"]
