  HOOKS [{"text":"They overheard two people they know settle a bribe, and do not know whom to tell.","source":"Jochi Olqunu'ud"},{"text":"Their son has been seen at night with people who do not work, and comes home with coin.","source":"Günji Olqunu'ud"},{"text":"They lent their savings to a friend who has since left, and the friend's family says there was no loan.","source":"Tümer Merkit"}]
