  LINE HOOKS [{"text":"A rival has hired away their two best hands in one week, on wages the rival cannot afford for long.","source":"Nomun Barlas"},{"text":"The timber carts stopped coming a month ago, and the builders are bidding against each other for what is left in the yards.","source":"Resource Conflict"},{"text":"A traditional practice conceals something the elders don't want examined.","source":"Generational Divide"}]
